{"id": "legend", "type": "text", "x": -40, "y": -260, "width": 560, "height": 200, "text": "**Module 020** — Cap-dependent Translation Initiation\n\n191 genes at their nodal-map positions. Green = + arm, red = − arm (the arms move opposite under the same drugs). Edge label + = move together, − = opposite."},
